---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Thinker Scripts"
	description="Thinker Scripts is a tech philosophy blog for philosophical developers interested in software engineering, systems thinking, first principles, and deep technical reading."
	keywords={[
		'philosophical developer',
		'philosophy of software engineering',
		'tech philosophy blog',
		'first principles software development',
		'minimalism in modern web engineering',
		'the ethics of automated code systems',
		'stoicism for software startup founders',
		'advanced Astro js implementation',
	]}
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">ABOUT</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-pretty text-neutral-950 sm:text-7xl dark:text-white">
			A tech philosophy blog for philosophical developers.
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
			Thinker Scripts is organized around long-form essays, filterable discovery, and article-level reading tools for developers who study software through philosophy, systems thinking, and first principles.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="border-y border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 py-14 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-4 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8">
			<div class="border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">01</p>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Home</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">A concise entry point with the newest essay and recent reading paths.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">02</p>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Library</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">A dedicated index for filtering by type, discipline, and reading time.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">03</p>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Posts</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">Independent essay pages with reading progress, search, typography controls, and Zen Mode.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
